From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 18:51:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 43/49] winewayland: Allow constraining xdg popups.

Some compositors dismiss constrained xdg popups when the positioner
leaves constraint adjustment at the default none value. This can
close menu like popups such as combo box dropdowns immediately after
they are created. Allow the compositor to slide, flip, or resize
popups when the requested position is constrained.
---
 dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c b/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c
index a45e9a44ea2..0b90d1025de 100644
--- a/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c
+++ b/dlls/winewayland.drv/wayland_surface.c
@@ -1641,6 +1641,13 @@ static struct xdg_positioner *create_xdg_positioner(RECT rect)
     xdg_positioner_set_anchor_rect(xdg_positioner, 0, 0, 1, 1);
     xdg_positioner_set_anchor(xdg_positioner, XDG_POSITIONER_ANCHOR_TOP_LEFT);
     xdg_positioner_set_gravity(xdg_positioner, XDG_POSITIONER_GRAVITY_BOTTOM_RIGHT);
+    xdg_positioner_set_constraint_adjustment(xdg_positioner,
+                                             XDG_POSITIONER_CONSTRAINT_ADJUSTMENT_SLIDE_X |
+                                             XDG_POSITIONER_CONSTRAINT_ADJUSTMENT_SLIDE_Y |
+                                             XDG_POSITIONER_CONSTRAINT_ADJUSTMENT_FLIP_X |
+                                             XDG_POSITIONER_CONSTRAINT_ADJUSTMENT_FLIP_Y |
+                                             XDG_POSITIONER_CONSTRAINT_ADJUSTMENT_RESIZE_X |
+                                             XDG_POSITIONER_CONSTRAINT_ADJUSTMENT_RESIZE_Y);
     xdg_positioner_set_offset(xdg_positioner, rect.left, rect.top);
     xdg_positioner_set_size(xdg_positioner, width, height);
     xdg_positioner_set_constraint_adjustment(
